OL,3,AUnions urge ministers to soften planned
OL,4,Achanges to immigration rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrade unions are putting pressure on
OL,7,Fthe government to soften proposed
OL,8,Fchanges to immigration rules, which
OL,9,Fwould make it harder for foreign
OL,10,Fworkers to secure permanent residency
OL,11,Fin the UK.
OL,13,FIf the plans are approved, most
OL,14,Fmigrants would have to wait 10 years to
OL,15,Fqualify for permanent residence, rather
OL,16,Fthan five years, while foreign workers
OL,17,Fon health and social care visas would
OL,18,Fface a 15-year wait.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
