OL,3,AUnions urge ministers to soften planned
OL,4,Achanges to immigration rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposals were announced last year
OL,7,Fby Home Secretary Shabana Mahmood, who
OL,8,Fhas kept the same role under new Prime
OL,9,FMinister Andy Burnham.
OL,11,FDelegates at the Trades Union Congress
OL,12,F(TUC) backed a motion calling for any
OL,13,Fchanges affecting workers already in
OL,14,Fthe UK to be withdrawn.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
